    "title": "Inter Collegiate Bilingual Public Speaking competition held at AKU",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) recently held its first ever Inter-Collegiate  Bilingual Public Speaking competition. Teams from fifteen institutions in  Karachi competed for the trophy",
