      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) recently held its first ever Inter-Collegiate Bilingual Public Speaking competition. Teams from fifteen institutions in Karachi competed for the trophy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The proud winners of the Team Trophy, Ghina Shamsi and S. Johar Raza, from Baqai Medical University, are seen along with the judges of the final round and the hosts from AKU From left to right: Mr. Obaidullah Baig, Mr Arif Ali Zaidi, Associate Dean, Student Affairs, AKU, Fatima Suraya Bajia, Mr. Sultan Masood, Dr. Shaista Khan, Faculty Advisor to the Arts and Cultural Committee, AKU Medical College, and Mr. Riaz Contractor of AKU."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
